<simplesect kind="return"><para>A comparator object that evaluates to true if <computeroutput>lhs</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>rhs</computeroutput> differ by at most <computeroutput>epsilon</computeroutput>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="since"><para>6.0.0</para>
</simplesect>
The <computeroutput><ref refid="group__micro-os-plus-micro-test-plus-cpp-api-deprecated-literals_1gafe47800a219b00fcccf0a1dc596dbe20" kindref="member">approx</ref></computeroutput> function template constructs a <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1approx__op" kindref="compound">detail::approx_op</ref></computeroutput> from the forwarded operands and tolerance; the operands are numbers, so <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1a51e86043001b197561806d5c6297041b" kindref="member">detail::as_operand()</ref></computeroutput>, which converts the C strings, is not needed. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
